@startuml
actor Пациент
participant "WebUI
(React)" as WebUI
participant "API Gateway
(Kong)" as Gateway
participant "DataUploadService
(Spring Boot)" as Upload
participant "FileValidator" as Validator
participant "AWS S3" as S3
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "RabbitMQ" as Queue

Пациент -> WebUI: Выбор файла
activate WebUI

WebUI -> Gateway: POST /upload
(multipart/form-data)
Authorization: Bearer {JWT}
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Gateway: Проверка JWT
Gateway -> Gateway: Rate Limiting
(100 req/min)

Gateway -> Upload: uploadData()
activate Upload

Upload -> Validator: validate(file)
activate Validator

Validator -> Validator: Проверка MIME-типа
Validator -> Validator: Проверка размера ≤10MB

alt Валидация не прошла
  Validator --> Upload: ValidationError
  Upload --> Gateway: 400 Bad Request
  Gateway --> WebUI: Ошибка валидации
  WebUI --> Пациент: Сообщение об ошибке
  deactivate Validator
  deactivate Upload
  deactivate Gateway
  deactivate WebUI
  [<-- Пациент
else Валидация успешна
  Validator --> Upload: Valid
  deactivate Validator
  
  par Параллельное сохранение
    Upload -> S3: PUT /medical-images-raw/{userId}/{fileId}
    activate S3
    S3 -> S3: Шифрование AES-256
    S3 --> Upload: S3 URL
    deactivate S3
  and
    Upload -> DB: INSERT INTO medical_data
    activate DB
    DB --> Upload: Metadata saved
    deactivate DB
  and
    Upload -> Queue: PUBLISH message
{fileId, userId, s3Url, fileType}
    activate Queue
    Queue --> Upload: ACK
    deactivate Queue
  end
  
  Upload --> Gateway: 201 Created + {fileId, s3Url}
  deactivate Upload
  
  Gateway --> WebUI: 201 Created
  deactivate Gateway
  
  WebUI --> Пациент: Загрузка успешна
  deactivate WebUI
end

@enduml